Getting Started# Fork and clone the repository:
bash Copy git clone https://github.com/projectious-work/aibox.git cd aibox Start the development container:
bash Copy cd .devcontainer docker compose up -d docker compose exec aibox bash Or open in VS Code with the Dev Containers extension.
Build the CLI:
